Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value LANES (\S+(?:,\S+)*)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value MTU (\d+)
Value FEC (\S+)
Value ALIAS (\S+)
Value VLAN (\S+)
Value OPER_STATUS (\S+)
Value ADMIN_STATUS (\S+)
Value TYPE (.+?)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Lanes\s+Speed\s+MTU\s+FEC\s+Alias\s+Vlan\s+Oper\s+Admin\s+Type\s*$$
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${LANES}\s+${SPEED}\s+${MTU}\s+${FEC}\s+${ALIAS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${OPER_STATUS}\s+${ADMIN_STATUS}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
